# Testing

- Place tests next to the code under test (`foo_test.go` in the same package).
- Use table-driven tests for handlers, store filters, and ingest edge cases.
- Run `go test -buildvcs=false ./...` locally; CI runs the same via `make test`.
- Prefer testing pure logic (query building, pagination math, NDJSON line parsing) over full HTTP integration unless needed.
